content.text:
Now game.js engine. Detailed features:

State:
```js
const SAVE_KEY = 'summer-door-save-v1';
const state = {
  dayIndex:0, beatIndex:0, affection: STORY.startAffection,
  memories: [], mood:'neutral', name:'민준',
  screen:'title', started:false, soundOn:false
};
```

DOM refs.

Functions:
- init(): populate petals; load save; update continue button; bind events; set screen title; render portrait name? Set name input from save name or 민준. Show saved affection in continue? No.
- setScreen('title'|'play').
