At 390x844 need save 174px to get actions bottom (873) within 844 (need 30) and quote within 844 (117). Full content fit requires 173. That's a lot. But ending can scroll; 30px cut of actions is the issue. We can just ensure actions fully visible above fold by saving 30px, then quote scrolls. Button being half-cut is the ugly part. Easiest: reduce mobile top padding / margins by ~40. On 360x640 it still scrolls (expected). Let's target 390x844.

Mobile max-width 900 ending rules currently:
```
.ending-inner{padding-top:calc(48px + safe)}
.ending-body{font-size:13.5;line-height:1.95}
```
Add:
```
.ending-eyebrow{margin-bottom:12px}
.ending-heart{margin:10px 0 20px}
.ending-body{margin-bottom:22px}
.ending-memories{gap:6px;margin-bottom:20px}
.ending-stats{margin-bottom:22px}
.ending-quote{margin-top:28px}
```
Saves: eyebrow 6, heart 4+10=14, body 10, memories 10, stats 12, quote 12 = 64. Then actionsBottom 809 <844, fully visible. Good. At 360x640 actionsBottom ~915, still below but scroll. Fine.

But note mobile "good ending" with only 2 memories already fits with lots; compressing makes it more compact, okay.

Let's add. Also for landscape ending (max-height 560) rule later overrides most, fine; the general max-width 900 applies to landscape too and then landscape rules override heart/memories/stats/quote? Landscape has heart 8/16, memories 18, stats 20, quote 20; ours set 20/22/28 respectively, but landscape comes later so wins. Body margin-bottom: landscape sets 18, ours 22; later landscape wins. Eyebrow margin-bottom not set in landscape; 12 vs base 18, fine.

Add to max-width:900 block near ending-body lines.

